#: epsstr.src%23KEY_VERSION_CHECK.string.text
msgid ""
"Warning: Not all of the imported EPS graphics could be saved at level1\n"
"as some are at a higher level!"
msgstr ""
"ማስጠንቀቂያ: የመጡትን ሁሉንም EPS ንድፎች ማስቀመጥ ይችላል በ ደረጃ1\n"
"አንዳንዶቹ ከፍተኛ ደረጃ ላይ ናቸው!"
